BT 1 0 0 1 0 83.2 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.2 Tf .141176 .203922 .278431 rg (VulnGuard is an educational, web-based security-scanning application developed using Python and Flask. It brings) Tj T* (together checks for Python package dependencies, selected risky Python source-code patterns, and possible) Tj T* (credential exposure in text files. The user submits a supported file through a local web dashboard, the relevant) Tj T* (scanner processes it, and the application displays findings for review.) Tj  T*  T* (VulnGuard is a learning prototype. It can help users notice selected risks, but it is not a complete security audit tool,) Tj T* (antivirus product, malware detector, or guarantee that an application is secure.) Tj T* ET
